<title>ESTONIA: EMV BOARD APPROVES RESULTS FOR 97 Q1.</title>
<headline>EMV BOARD APPROVES RESULTS FOR 97 Q1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of EMV, one of Estonia's largest construction companies, said it has approved its results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The free market listed company confirmed its earlier figures of a net profit of 1.1 million kroons, net turnover of 53.2 million kroons and gross profit of 5.9 million kroons in a statement.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
